        <mxCell id="y6c3Vtqz6U0YL3FhFZXc-34" value="&lt;li&gt;Overview of Traditional IT Infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Discussion on its disadvantages:&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;High infrastructure cost.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Manual hardware management.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Limited scalability.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;High maintenance effort.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Longer deployment time.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Disaster recovery challenges.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#666666;fillColor=#f5f5f5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontColor=#333333;" parent="1" vertex="1">
