        <mxCell id="y6c3Vtqz6U0YL3FhFZXc-38" value="&lt;h3&gt;Introduction to Cloud Computing&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Understanding Cloud Computing and its benefits.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Key advantages discussed:&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;On-demand resource availability.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Pay-as-you-go pricing model.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;High availability.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Scalability.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Reduced operational overhead.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#666666;fillColor=#f5f5f5;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontColor=#333333;" parent="1" vertex="1">
